mories. So help me!\"\n\nIn order to survive as the greatest doctor, I need the greatest person to protect me! My dad!\nWake up, dad!\n\n===\n\nI signed a contract with my dad in exchange for helping him find his memories.\n\nOn the way, I helped out a girl, as well as my younger uncle.\n\nWhile also saving my big uncle, and cousin.\n\n\"I'm going home!\"\n\"No, don't go, Big sis!\"\n\"My daughter's crying, so I forbid you from leaving.\"\n\"I'm going!\"\n\nOh my goodness!\nEveryone’s trying to make me stay.\n\nBut I’m dead set on throwing everything away and leaving!\n\nCan I really stay away for long?","year":2024,"status":"completed","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Historical","Romance","Isekai","Medical","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/8e0bab9b-162d-437b-866f-3d2bdc70710c/209dcc83-4638-4858-a698-18f88bd5d434.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["fr","en"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":8.46,"follows":449,"listAt":"2026-10-25T18:53:40.450Z","chapters":[{"id":"7c2a6685-b9ea-4fe5-b3f2-ac74568a7b49","number":null,"volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":12,"createdAt":"2024-09-16T04:32:35+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"d59222ae-5fc7-4760-b121-95b95f85ff88","number":null,"volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":13,"createdAt":"2024-11-28T21:04:47+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":2,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-19T10:31:57.725Z"},"dc132107-12de-4dd1-b896-09b18b9ed81f":{"id":"dc132107-12de-4dd1-b896-09b18b9ed81f","title":"My Favorite Savior Girl","altTitle":"My Favorite salvation girl","description":"[Translated by Mystic Willow Scans] As Lee Yeo-ju hums a song that comforted her during her long hospital stay, she is approached by an idol star named Park Jae-ha, whom she has only seen in videos. \"I'll help you. You need money for the surgery, right?\" Jae-ha becomes Yeo-ju's savior and favorite. However, five years later, he ends his life by making an extreme choice... Yeo-ju, in shock, cries out to a 